      "settings": {
        "show_badge": false,
        "show_stars": false,
        "badge_text": "21K+ Happy Customers",
        "badge_size_desktop": 12,
        "badge_size_mobile": 11,
        "badge_spacing": 28,
        "content": "<p>Memberships – Our members get the best prices on floats, free 90 minute float, and discounted float for friends and family. Pay monthly, no minimum term.</p><p></p><p>Memberships are a great option even if you just want to try out floating – only stay with us if you want to.</p><p></p><p>Since floating is a practice that has a learning curve and an accumulative effect, the more often you float, the better and more effective they get.</p><p>If you are interested in adding a float practice to your routine, you’ll get the best value by becoming a member.</p>",
