    "collapsible_content_UXFXUY": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_ftWWqL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I send an electronic gift card?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you have the option of a digital gift card. When you go to purchase one from our online store, you will have the option of sending it via email on a scheduled date that you choose (ex. birthday or anniversary).  You can also write a personalised message for the recipient. Simply choose Gift Cards on the Menu.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UxKkEw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I redeem a gift card I received?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>If you received an electronic gift card, you can easily book your session online. Go to our booking system and login or create an account. You’ll need to choose the services that correspond with your gift card and enter your card number upon checkout.</p><p>Give us a call at +020 3666 0895 or email us at info@floathub.co.uk if you received a physical gift card or if you have any questions or issues!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
